  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/4c896ead3319b300aba2a2b521b05f502be02a7111480f7f1e660ae0bc85b631.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"\"><li>Độ lớn trọng lực tác động lên đèn chùm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.</li><li>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chóp tứ giác đều suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\t\t\n\t\t\tMà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo></mrow></semantics></math> tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều.<br>\n\t\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> \n\t\t\tTa có Hợp lực của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> sợi xích là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tĐể đèn chùm đứng yên thì hợp lực của các sợi xích phải cân bằng với trọng lực hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tXét tam giác đều <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy độ lớn của lực căng cho mỗi sợi xích là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> (N).<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>91</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
